    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire this substantial end of terrace Pre’63 investment arranged in 4 spacious apartments (3 x 1 Beds & 1 x 2 Bed) ) and situated in this village centre location, minutes from numerous and varied restaurants and gourmet shops. The house is across the road from Phibsborough Luas station. The property extends to c. 145 sq. m. The property offers superb potential to be transformed to a high yielding and lucrative investment property. The house retains many period features including coving, cornicing and original staircase. To the rear is a south facing walled garden with pedestrian access from the side, No. 284 offers an excellent opportunity for conversion to a stylish single-family home. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nEntrance hall \t\t               7.66m x 1.42m    \t\twith dado rail and cornice.\r\n\r\nApartment 1 - 1 bedroom \r\n\r\nLiving room/kitchen \t\t4.28m x 3.88m \t\tbright bay window, fully fitted kitchen, plumbed for washing machine, wooden floor, original window shutters.\r\n\r\nShower room \t\t               2.43m x 1.15m \t\tfully tiled with WC, WHB and shower, with glass screen.\r\nBedroom \t\t\t       2.64m x 4.06m \t\tdouble bedroom, with original window shutters and coving.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGround floor return\r\n\r\nApartment 2 – 1 bedroom\r\n\r\nKitchen and living room \t\t \t5.41m x 3.24m  \t\ttiled, wooden floor. Fitted kitchen, plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nShower room \t\t\t                2.43m x 1.15m \t\tfully tiled with WC, WHB and shower with glass screen.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom \t\t\t\t        3.20m x 2.04m\t\tdouble bedroom, fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nFirst floor return \r\n\r\nApartment 3 – 1 bedroom \r\n\r\nKitchen and living room \t\t \t4.53m x 3.35m  \t\tpart tiled, part wooden floor. Fitted kitchen, plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nShower room \t\t\t               2.43m x 1.15m \t\tfully tiled with WC, WHB and shower, with glass screen.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom \t\t\t\t        3.35m x 2.04m\t\tdouble bedroom, wooden floor, fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nFirst floor \r\n\r\nApartment 4 – 2 bedrooms \r\n\r\nKitchen and living room \t\t \t4.08m x 3.93m  \t\tfully fitted kitchen, plumbed for washing machine with wooden floor.\r\n\r\nShower room \t\t\t               2.28m x 1.15m \t\tfully tiled with WC, WHB and shower.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 1 \t\t\t\t      3.91m x 3.25m\t\t        double bedroom, bay window, with fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \t\t\t\t       3.35m x 2.04m\t\t        double bedroom, wooden floor, with fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nOutside \r\nThe property is nicely set back from the road behind wrought iron railings. To the rear is an enclosed patio garden (7.68m x 4.10m) currently set out as a patio. This enjoys a pleasant south facing aspect and provides good privacy. Please note the garage to the rear is excluded from the sale."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Vacant possession available\r\nSought after Phibsborough location \r\nSouth facing rear garden\r\nExcellent rental location\r\nOn street parking (DCC permit) \r\n10 meters from LUAS \r\nWalking distance to TU Dublin Grangegorman Campus & Mater Hospital"
      },
